% Bus fixture, world A: the scout rides out and reports whether
% the pass is clear. Its verdict leaves the world through the
% driver (bus blackboard), never through shared state.
catalog scout 1.
provenance hand "bus fixture: scout — is the pass clear" "2026-10-03".
layers (dyn).
stages (look).
namespace st produce (dyn).
pred patrol : st.
pred clear : st.
pred blocked : st.
stage look {
  %% the pass is open.
  open [dyn] : patrol -o clear @w 3.
  %% rockfall: the pass is blocked.
  block [dyn] : patrol -o blocked @w 1.
}
#init patrol 1
#steps 1
